{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026ZUxewqf2BZ1794211333.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>處境劇《愛．回家之三代同糖》一眾演員歐瑞偉、李茵彤、李偉健、何依婷、周志康、趙浚承、容天佑、吳兆麟、潘靜文、關曜儁、林沚羿日前（8日）快閃北角春秧街街市與觀眾互動。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"e284355e-cacb-48b4-88bc-ea8c05323976.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026nsKAqDifTu1794211332.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>在宣傳活動上，歐瑞偉與李偉健特別穿上「爆肌衫」配搭拳擊手套亮相，造型極度吸睛。眾人為爭奪圓圓（何依婷飾）展開「擂台對決」愛的比拼，吸引大批沿途路人及粉絲圍觀支持，場面熱鬧。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"091e3a37-d515-4214-a8e0-e7b2af2b47e8.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026feQsYcLOLL1794211332.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.124846+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T08:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:09.266465+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:31.226961+00:00","content_hash":"b13f4dcdac994debd2e9ff44e77c74ffedb7578af075bcb53cde61f3ec5d8ad0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.124846+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}